# Twilight Syndrome: Tansaku-hen (SLPS-00102), the chapter in the disc folder DAT/CAPX.
# This chapter's kanji and marks, 0x010C-0x0235, in the order of the chapter's font on the disc;
# 16-bit little-endian codes, keys in memory byte order. Goes after SLPS-00102.tbl (the shared codes).
# 283 glyphs are bit for bit ones already read for Kyuumei-hen; the other 15 were read by eye here. All were
# then checked in the scenes' words.
# Not checked in a scene, since none uses them: 0x017A, 0x018C.
